 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Moses wrote the song that day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He taught the people what to say",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord spoke to Joshua son of Nun",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Be strong and brave, the work is done",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will bring them into the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I swore to give with my own hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I myself shall be with you there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No fear shall cloud your solemn care",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take this Book of the Law",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Place it by the ark forever",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It stands as a witness against you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For I know your hearts are few",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rebellious and stiff-necked is your way",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Even now in my life today",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the writing was finished completely",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the first verse to the final beat",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave the command to the Levite",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who carries the ark of God's light",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Place it beside the covenant seat",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There it will remain in the street",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A witness against you, the people see",
